pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 500, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: "11 — BUSINESS IMPACT & ROI"
  - elementId: claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 84, 800, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>A transparent value model — <span style="color:$primary">assumptions stay assumptions</span>.</p>
  - elementId: formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 140, 800, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      color: "$dim"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Annual value V = N × E × H × W × R <span style="font-size:12px">(engineers · engaged share · hours saved/week · 46 weeks · loaded rate ≈ $112)</span></p>
  - elementId: table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [80, 190, 800, 180]
    columnWidths: [0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.22, 0.22]
    rowHeights: [0.22, 0.26, 0.26, 0.26]
    style:
      cellStyle:
        fontSize: 12
        color: "$dim"
        align: [left, middle]
        border: [null, null, {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}, null]
      firstRowStyle:
        color: "$primary"
        bold: true
        fontSize: 12
        letterSpacing: 1
        border: [null, null, {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary"}, null]
    rows:
      - - text: "SCENARIO @ 1,000 ENGINEERS"
        - text: "ENGAGED (E)"
        - text: "H/WEEK (H)"
        - text: "CAPACITY VALUE/YR"
        - text: "ROI @ C = $150K"
      - - text: "Conservative"
        - text: "30% · assumption"
        - text: "0.5 · assumption"
        - text: "$0.77M"
        - text: "415%"
      - - text: "Expected"
          color: "$text"
          bold: true
        - text: "50% · assumption"
          color: "$text"
        - text: "1.5 · assumption"
          color: "$text"
        - text: "$3.86M"
          color: "$text"
          bold: true
        - text: "2,476%"
          color: "$primary"
          bold: true
      - - text: "Optimistic"
        - text: "70% · assumption"
        - text: "3.0 · assumption"
        - text: "$10.8M"
        - text: "7,113%"
  - elementId: caveats
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 392, 800, 108]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <ul><li>Saved time is <strong>capacity, not cash</strong>; quality upside is excluded — the model stays conservative. Plausibility: 0.5 h/week ≈ 1.2% of a working week, below the 2.5% flaky tests alone consume.</li><li>Adoption needs <strong>no new licenses or infrastructure</strong> — stdlib Python. A 4–6 week pilot on 2–3 volunteer teams measures team-level before/after, reported as association.</li><li>Reusable across LOBs: the stack-agnostic agent kit drops into any repo; context covers Java, .NET, Python, TypeScript, Playwright.</li></ul>
  - elementId: src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 508, 800, 22]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Sources for every cited figure: docs/research/evidence.md. Full model and stress case (C = $500K): docs/business-case.md.</p>
  - elementId: pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 512, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "13"
